  data: {
    LLM: "Memorize the first few syllables ('Kimari-ji') of each poem. Many poems can be identified after just 1, 2, or 3 syllables.\n\nTerritory management: Group poems with similar starting sounds together so your hand is already in the right area when the reader begins.\n\nDefensive posture: Position cards you are less confident in at the edges of your territory to make them harder for the opponent to steal.",
